# Negation over a fact derived in the same program, and a fact emitted and
# retracted within one pump. `make_artifact` fires first ([LDET.5.4]) and
# emits a logical Artifact while no Refusal exists; `publish_refusal` then
# emits the Refusal, the NOT node withdraws `make_artifact`'s match, and the
# Artifact, justified by that activation alone, is retracted.
assert Build id=1
assert RefusalText id=1
pump
